    <item>
      <title>LeetCode–统计更小值数量</title>
      <link>https://buhuipao.github.io/2017/05/19/leetcode-countsmaller/</link>
      <pubDate>Fri, 19 May 2017 08:45:55 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://buhuipao.github.io/2017/05/19/leetcode-countsmaller/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Time: O(nlogn)&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Space: O(n)&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;You are given an integer array nums and you have to&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;return a new counts array. The counts array has the&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;property where counts[i] is the number of smaller&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;elements to the right of nums[i].&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Example:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Given nums = [5, 2, 6, 1]&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;To the right of 5 there are 2 smaller elements (2 and 1).&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;To the right of 2 there is only 1 smaller element (1).&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
